From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:48:29 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: isp: Keep T8140 off the T6040 setfile and main
 memory paths

Two changes in the T6040 series also act on the T8140 (MacBook Neo),
which runs the same H17 firmware interface:

- Commit ed7b2a4d3a7f ("media: apple: isp: Zero the lens shading strides
  of H17 setfiles") rewrites the lens shading records of every setfile
  loaded on H17 firmware. It was only seen to matter on T6040, and the
  T8140 camera streams with its setfiles unchanged.
- Commit 316136216030 ("media: apple: isp: Add T6040 support") reads a
  "data" memory-region for every SoC, maps zeroed pages above it, and
  fails the probe when it does not fit the heap. The T8140 regions come
  from the bootloader, and nothing has checked how that would behave
  there.

Limit both to ISP_GEN_T6040, so the T8140 boot and capture paths stay
as they were until they are tested on that machine.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit 7d20cd47628688f46b49c15874f93aaa48e1fb9c)
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c | 3 ++-
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
index a5881c35ff..a266c60609 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
@@ -425,7 +425,8 @@ static int isp_ch_load_setfile(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 	memcpy(isp->data_surf->virt, fw->data, len);
 	memset(isp->data_surf->virt + len, 0, setfile->size - len);
 	release_firmware(fw);
-	if (isp->hw->fw_abi == ISP_FW_ABI_H17)
+	/* Seen on T6040 only; T8140 runs its setfiles as they are. */
+	if (isp->hw->gen == ISP_GEN_T6040)
 		isp_setfile_fixup_h17(isp->data_surf->virt, len);
 
 	return isp_cmd_ch_set_file_load(isp, ch, isp->data_surf->iova,
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
index 2d954e864b..db928fb9c2 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
@@ -203,7 +203,9 @@ static int apple_isp_init_iommu(struct apple_isp *isp)
 	 * firmware's main memory only up to the end of it. The rest, up to
 	 * the heap top, is the host's to back.
 	 */
-	err = isp_of_region_iova(dev, "data", &data_base, &data_size);
+	err = -ENOENT;
+	if (isp->hw->gen == ISP_GEN_T6040)
+		err = isp_of_region_iova(dev, "data", &data_base, &data_size);
 	if (!err) {
 		isp->fw.data_top = data_base + data_size;
 		if (isp->fw.data_top <= isp->fw.heap_base ||
